    - `fireEvent.click` the row's first `.hand-hint`.
    - Then `screen.getByTestId(testid.handCard("h1")).closest(".hand-slot")` has `data-lifted="true"`, and `onClick` was called with `{ on: "hand", instanceId: "h1" }`.

Commands, run in this order:
```
pnpm --dir apps/web test src/game/HandHints.test.tsx src/game/Hand.test.tsx src/game/Card.test.tsx src/game/Board.test.tsx src/palette.test.ts src/typescale.test.ts src/typography.test.ts src/i18n/i18n.test.ts src/writing.test.ts
